# Multi-sound from the panel (docs/15 §3.16), with Macro
# as Sound 1 and Shapes, through an Ensemble insert, as Sound 2:
# PLAY/STOP; SHIFT (SEL held) + PRESETS makes Sound 2 current; a key and a
# MIDI IN note play it, and KNOB2 turns its Timbre; FX mode, SELECT back to
# the Mix page, KNOB2 and KNOB1 set the two levels; HOME, SHIFT + PRESETS
# back to Sound 1, whose key and MIDI IN note play it; PLAY/STOP stops.
--button 0.05:PLAY/STOP
--button 0.30:SEL:0.20
--turn 0.35:PRESETS:1
--key 0.60:7:100:0.30
--note 0.65:64:90:0.20
--turn 0.70:KNOB2:10
--button 0.90:FX
--turn 0.95:SELECT:-1
--turn 1.00:KNOB2:-20
--turn 1.05:KNOB1:-10
--button 1.10:HOME
--button 1.20:SEL:0.20
--turn 1.25:PRESETS:-1
--key 1.40:0:100:0.30
--note 1.50:60:80:0.25
--button 2.20:PLAY/STOP
